Z||000000||new fiero||08-08-2001||08:09 PM||||STORY:<P>Put my 88 L4 Iron Duke into my 86 coupe.  Along with the ECM, Throttle cable, shift cables, and tranny...  Worked great for 2 weeks; passed emissions...etc...<P>PROBLEM/SYMPTOMS:<P>Car is now back firing in every gear and jerking like crazy--replaced charcoal canister..no help...seems a little worse..<P>Car seems to be overheating.  Fan not coming on at all....replaced sensor...  no help...  did temp gauge fix...temp. doesn't get above 100.  can connect connector together with a piece of wire to get fan to stay on continuously, other wise won't run....<P>I am leaning towards a bad ECM....What are your thoughts....<P>Andy<P><P>------------------<BR>newfiero<BR>(swapping 88 L4 to 86 and having fun!)<BR>Yahoo! Messenger id: newfiero||||reg||4
