Z||000005||88CoupeV6||08-09-2001||10:20 AM||||88 coupe did that to me left me stranded 40 miles from home. I replaced the crank sensor and coil packs. I also was going to have the module replaced but the parts place tested it and said it was fine. I was about to give up then was told to put low resistance plug wires. I argued because the old ones were only 6 months old. I replaced them and it ran great until I replaced it with the V6.<P>------------------<BR>Josh<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://people.ne.mediaone.net/fiero64/Fiero642.jpg">   <BR><B>Also 88 Yellow GT</B> :D  <BR><A HREF="http://albums.photopoint.com/j/AlbumList?u=1249362" TARGET=_blank>My pics</A>||||reg||7
